{"repositoryId":1421047114,"availability":"available","full":"soham24/live-call-translator","name":"live-call-translator","description":"Live phone-call translator in the browser: hear Chinese as English text, reply in English and play it back as Chinese speech. No API keys, zero dependencies.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-15T16:46:48Z","updated":"2026-10-15T17:52:59Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://live-call-translator.netlify.app","topics":["chinese","netlify","speech-recognition","text-to-speech","translation","web-speech-api"],"demo":"https://live-call-translator.netlify.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:11.397Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:11.397Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:11.397Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:48:11.397Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A zero-dependency web app for phone calls on speaker with someone who speaks Chinese.","It runs entirely in the browser using free services. There are no API keys, accounts or build steps.","Live demo: (open in Chrome or Edge). Add #demo to the URL to see a sample conversation."],"features":["They speak Chinese → you read English, live, on screen.","You type English (or pick a saved phrase) → it's translated to Chinese → press Play and your laptop speaker says it to the caller.","Live Chinese speech recognition with a rolling English translation while the caller is still talking","Mandarin (Mainland / Taiwan) and Cantonese (Hong Kong)","Saved phrases as big tap-to-play tiles (or keys 1–9), with an edit mode for reordering and JSON export/import"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soham24/live-call-translator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d5a3bf3961423caa4ff9d0e58cca7932fe11c2e414d313b71d4c6224a255022a","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:11.471Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:11.471Z","projectInsight